Mobile application "Wasabi sushi №1" — a comfortable way to order food from your favourite restaurant in Israel.
Application options:
- Fast and easy food order;
- Actual menu, tasty descriptions & yammi photos;
- Interesting offers & fresh news;
- Mobile bonus card;
- Feedback;
